  "goodToKnow": "Das Bundesamt is a federal office or agency. Germany has dozens: das Statistische Bundesamt (Destatis), das Bundesamt für Migration und Flüchtlinge (BAMF), das Bundesamt für Sicherheit in der Informationstechnik (BSI). Der Bund means the federation, as opposed to die Länder (the states). Many Bundesämter are deliberately located outside Berlin, in cities like Bonn, Wiesbaden and Nuremberg."
